1
00:00:00,317 --> 00:00:02,727
Well, that's the last time
I play with that.

2
00:00:06,490 --> 00:00:08,060
I have to take this.

3
00:00:08,892 --> 00:00:10,272
(Mrs Wolowitz(on phone):)Hello?

4
00:00:11,328 --> 00:00:12,808
Off. (TV STOPS)

5
00:00:12,896 --> 00:00:14,566
And on. (TV STARTS)

6
00:00:14,598 --> 00:00:16,408
(Raj:)And the Oprah Network.

7
00:00:17,601 --> 00:00:20,271
(Raj:)This is so much better than
watching TV like a muggle.

8
00:00:22,239 --> 00:00:25,119
(Howard:)Okay. Thank you.
We'll be in touch.

9
00:00:27,611 --> 00:00:28,991
(Howard:)You're not gonna believe this.

10
00:00:29,846 --> 00:00:30,946
(Raj:)What's going on?

11
00:00:31,815 --> 00:00:33,155
(Leonard:)Wait.

12
00:00:34,151 --> 00:00:35,361
On!

13
00:00:35,519 --> 00:00:36,999
And off!

14
00:00:38,688 --> 00:00:40,288
(Raj:)What's going on?

15
00:00:43,326 --> 00:00:45,366
(Howard:)That was NASA.

16
00:00:45,462 --> 00:00:48,842
(Howard:)They want me to go
back up to the space station.

17
00:00:50,133 --> 00:00:51,513
(Raj:)Wow. What did you tell them?

18
00:00:51,668 --> 00:00:53,168
I told them I'd be honored.

19
00:00:54,037 --> 00:00:56,607
(Raj:)A second trip to space.
I'll miss you.

